00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:22.570
All right.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:26.940
So I grabbed the URL
for the test dispatcher.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:32.243
And I'm going to Pub/Sub
subscriptions now.

00:10:32.243 --> 00:10:32.910
TIANZI CAI: Yes.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:36.060
Let's go to
dispatcher-sub-ordered.

00:10:39.057 --> 00:10:40.140
MARTIN OMANDER: All right.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.940
Dispatcher-sub-ordered.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.020
I'm going into that one.

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:44.880
TIANZI CAI: Let's go
into the subscription

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:47.443
and to create a snapshot.

00:10:47.443 --> 00:10:48.235
MARTIN OMANDER: OK.

00:10:50.903 --> 00:10:51.570
TIANZI CAI: Yep.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.820
MARTIN OMANDER: Great snapshot.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:53.360
All right.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.287
TIANZI CAI: Let's
give it a name.

00:11:01.287 --> 00:11:02.370
MARTIN OMANDER: All right.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.975
