00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.420
So go to Subscriptions.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.930
MARTIN OMANDER: OK.

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.143
Create new
subscription you said?

00:11:24.143 --> 00:11:24.810
TIANZI CAI: Yes.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.750
MARTIN OMANDER: All right.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:38.840
I think I might call this
