00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.757
TIANZI CAI: You want it to
retain acknowledged messages.

00:12:15.757 --> 00:12:17.090
MARTIN OMANDER: Oh, there it is.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.810
Retain acknowledged messages.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.510
Yeah.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:26.367
TIANZI CAI: And go ahead
and create the subscription.

00:12:26.367 --> 00:12:27.450
MARTIN OMANDER: All right.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.350
TIANZI CAI: Very
